OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas trees among assets in
OL,4,Acouncil break-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Telford council preparing for a
OL,7,F"divorce" next year has yet to decide
OL,8,Fwho gets what.
OL,10,FSt George's and Priorslee Parish
OL,11,FCouncil will split as part of a
OL,12,Fboundary reorganisation, but
OL,13,Fcouncillors are still arguing over
OL,14,Fassets ranging from benches and bus
OL,15,Fshelters to Christmas trees and the
OL,16,FPercy the Snake artwork.
OL,18,FOne of the biggest points of
OL,19,Fdisagreement is The Gower, the
OL,20,Fcouncil's headquarters in St George's.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
